1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,880
Five things you must never do in
Mongolia.

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:06,733
Don't point at someone with one
finger.

3
00:00:06,783 --> 00:00:08,369
Use your whole open hand.

4
00:00:09,819 --> 00:00:12,583
Don't touch anyone's hat, and
never tap a head.

5
00:00:14,033 --> 00:00:16,579
Don't throw trash or water into
the fire.

6
00:00:16,629 --> 00:00:17,465
It is sacred.

7
00:00:18,915 --> 00:00:20,447
Don't refuse tea or food.

8
00:00:20,497 --> 00:00:22,346
Take it with your right hand.

9
00:00:23,796 --> 00:00:26,081
And don't ask how long the trip
will take.

10
00:00:26,131 --> 00:00:27,805
Locals say it brings bad luck.
